  "_readme": [
    "Demo catalog for: python manage.py seed_demo",
    "collections: matched by slug (derived from name when slug is omitted).",
    "products: regular stock-tracked products. Give either 'variants' (explicit list) or 'variant_matrix' (sizes x colors, same stock each).",
    "custom_templates: custom order templates (kind=CUSTOM). No variants; use custom_sizes / custom_colors.",
    "defaults: merged into every product and template unless the item sets the field itself.",
    "Sizes: XS, S, M, L, XL, XXL, XXXL, ONE_SIZE. Genders: MEN, WOMEN, UNISEX, KIDS. Status: DRAFT, ACTIVE, ARCHIVED.",
    "Collection types: CATEGORY, FESTIVE, EDIT. Prices are in BDT.",
    "Image URLs are placeholders; replace them with your own (e.g. Cloudinary) URLs.",
    "reviews: store-wide reviews, created APPROVED (staff source). Optional 'product' = product name slug."
  ],

